      "text": "heavens and earth created by Jesus Christ, D&C 14:9 (45:1; 76:24; 93:10; 104:14; 117:6). God created male and female after his image, D&C 20:18. the Lord created all things by power of his Spirit, D&C 29:30–31 (45:1). relationships of temporal and spiritual creation, D&C 29:31–32. the Lord spoke and world was made, D&C 38:3. all things that live were made by the Lord, D&C 45:1. earth to answer end of its creation, D&C 49:16. man created before world was made, D&C 49:17. God made world in six days, D&C 77:12. Christ is power by which sun was made, D&C 88:7. earth to fill measure of its creation, D&C 88:19, 25. earth created for celestial beings, D&C 88:20. intelligence, or light of truth, was not created, D&C 93:29. the Lord makes every man steward over earthly blessings he has made for his creatures, D&C 104:13. let eternal creations declare the Lord’s name, D&C 128:23.",
